unsteady cabinets.

00:03:34.614 --> 00:03:35.882
Of course everyone´s like,

00:03:35.882 --> 00:03:38.284
"Hey, Colton, why don´t you just
go grab a chair?"

00:03:38.284 --> 00:03:39.786 align:start size:94% position:6%
