"Nah, I´m good, I´m good.

00:03:39.786 --> 00:03:41.221 size:78% position:39%
I´m gonna stay here."

00:03:41.221 --> 00:03:43.590
And they´re like, "Really, we
think you should get the chair."

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:44.991 align:start size:94% position:6%
"No, I´m cool, man.
I don´t wanna --

00:03:44.991 --> 00:03:47.460
I don´t -- I don´t use chairs!"

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:50.029 align:start size:94% position:6%
And of course we made a sketch
about that.

00:03:50.029 --> 00:03:52.899 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, if you can,
check out "Proud Thug."

00:03:52.899 --> 00:03:55.001 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just put that in Google,
look up,

00:03:55.001 --> 00:03:56.236 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you´ll see a sketch
about a guy

00:03:56.236 --> 00:03:58.538 align:start size:94% position:6%
who refuses to sit in a chair.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:58.538 --> 00:03:59.906 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That´s fantastic.

00:03:59.906 --> 00:04:01.708 align:start size:94% position:6%
That´s how easy comedy writing
could be on a good day.

00:04:01.708 --> 00:04:03.610 align:start size:94% position:6%
When you´re with your friends
on a good day.

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:06.846
-I typed that up and I was gone.
Slid down the dinosaur tail.

00:04:06.846 --> 00:04:09.315 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You didn´t need a seat.
You were in and out.

00:04:09.315 --> 00:04:13.620 align:start size:94% position:6%
So you on "Superstore,"
you play customer service.

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:14.954 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I do.
-You do customer service.

00:04:14.954 --> 00:04:17.624 size:84% position:42%
Did you ever have a job
like that in real life?

00:04:17.624 --> 00:04:18.925 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, I did.

00:04:18.925 --> 00:04:21.327 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, I actually --
I worked at a video store.

00:04:21.327 --> 00:04:23.529
And what a video store was

00:04:23.529 --> 00:04:24.797 align:start size:94% position:6%
is a store
where people would go to...

00:04:24.797 --> 00:04:26.199 align:start size:94% position:6%
