00:04:26.199 --> 00:04:28.401
...and they´d rent a video
and then they´d take it home.

00:04:28.401 --> 00:04:31.738
They´d watch it and then they´d
take it back to me

00:04:31.738 --> 00:04:33.072
and I would put it on a shelf
and somebody else would --

00:04:33.072 --> 00:04:34.974
-Now, let´s say there´s a movie
I really want to see

00:04:34.974 --> 00:04:36.376 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I come in
and you don´t have it.

00:04:36.376 --> 00:04:38.111 size:88% position:44%
Did you have another one
that you could give me?

00:04:38.111 --> 00:04:40.280
-I mean, I would have all sorts
of recommendations

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:41.414 align:start size:94% position:6%
