00:04:41.414 --> 00:04:42.515 align:start size:94% position:6%
maybe in a similar genre
that you could rent.

00:04:42.515 --> 00:04:43.549 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Gotcha.

00:04:43.549 --> 00:04:47.086 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Basically I was Netflix...
-Yeah.

00:04:47.086 --> 00:04:48.855 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...before Netflix.
-That´s great.

00:04:48.855 --> 00:04:54.127 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That´s what I was, yeah.
